## The Qwen3 Thinking Mode Issue (Read Before Implementing)

Every Qwen3 model supports two modes toggled via the system prompt: `/think` (extended chain-of-thought, slow) and `/no_think` (direct response, fast). This is not optional configuration — you must set it explicitly per slot or the model defaults to thinking mode and your Fast slot will produce a multi-second `` block before the three-word JSON you need. The models.toml needs a `thinking` field, and your `EmbeddedLlamaCpp` must inject the right token into the system prompt for each slot.


